{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T67hjxQ48jz41W1gJuTozE","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# nlp_variance_gtheory — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 22:21 UTC | 更新原因: Dream #1 审稿反馈处理完毕，framing 全面修订，re-dream 提交\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nCross-benchmark G-theory 方差分解：item dominance 是 benchmark-conditional 的，variance structure 随 task type 系统性变化，无 universal reproducibility recipe。详见 `paper_framing.md`。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP PASS → framing revised → re-dream 中）\\\\n- **MVP**: PASS — item_id=58.4%, separability <0.5%, dual-metric (binary G=0.357, text G=0.975)\\\\n- **Dream #1**: Best 3/6, Median 4/6, Worst 3/6 — 9 个结构性问题已修复 framing\\\\n- **Dream #2**: dream_20260520T222113 pending（验证 framing 修复）\\\\n- **P0 实验**: 0/5 started（等 re-dream 通过后批准）\\\\n- **代码准备**: exp-001 pipeline dry-run PASS, 5184 条件设计矩阵就绪\\\\n- **模型下载**: Llama ✅, Mistral/Qwen3/Gemma 下载中（预计 ~3h）\\\\n- **磁盘**: 根 41% (18G free), 数据盘 19% (284G free)\\\\n\\\\n## P0 实验状态\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 描述 | GPU-h | 状态 | 阻塞项 |\\\\n|----|------|-------|------|--------|\\\\n| exp-001 | 4 models × 3 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items | 100 | 代码就绪 | re-dream |\\\\n| exp-001b | Item resampling stability (3 independent 200-item samples) | 15 | planned | exp-001 |\\\\n| exp-002 | Multi-benchmark (GSM8K, ARC, HellaSwag) | 200 | 采样脚本就绪 | exp-001 |\\\\n| exp-003 | Multi-hardware G-study | 120 | **BLOCKED** | 第二种 GPU（已催 Manager ×2） |\\\\n| exp-004 | D-study + model-as-facet + bootstrap CIs + REML + logprobs + IRT 对比 | 0 | planned | exp-001/002/003 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 re-dream 回调 → 评分达标后批准 exp-001\\\\n- [ ] 监控模型下载完成（Mistral/Qwen3-Instruct/Gemma）\\\\n- [ ] Agent 实现 model path mapping（方案 C 已批准）\\\\n- [ ] Agent 修复 Qwen3-8B→Instruct + Template 6 大小写（已派指