{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01P3E5Z9Z4Q9fXeFwxkTxFr3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RZndbm5XURbbYN6iytckiP","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"nlp_variance_gtheory","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3938,"cache_read_input_tokens":17692,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3938,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":42,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01K7AL2fpPZiLZyhDeHBuaaJ","session_id":"7a1cd9cb-5673-4b3d-b760-963c998bdaf6","uuid":"2a18b56b-f6bd-4ee3-ac34-c4cfe9cf45db"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RZndbm5XURbbYN6iytckiP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — nlp_variance_gtheory\\\\n\\\\n## Gated Model 约束 (2026-05-20)\\\\nLlama-3.1-8B-Instruct 和 gemma-2-9b-it 是 HF gated models，直接用 repo ID 加载失败。westd-32570 上通过 ModelScope 下载到本地路径（如 `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/LLM-Research/Meta-Llama-3___1-8B-Instruct`）。exp-001 正式运行需要 model path mapping 或 HF token。\\\\n\\\\n## 双 Metric 设计决策 (2026-05-20, D002)\\\\nbinary_correct 和 text_exact_match 测量正交维度（Spearman ρ = −0.21, n.s.）。前者衡量评估有效性（item 难度主导），后者衡量可复现性（prompt×item + temperature 主导）。两者必须同时保留——不能互相替代。\\\\n\\\\n## Temperature 对 text_match 的决定性影响 (2026-05-20)\\\\nT=0 → text_match=0.247, T=0.5 → text_match=0.019（降 92%），但 binary_correct 几乎不变。这是 G-theory 框架的关键洞察：采样随机性改变文本表述但不改变答案选择。\\\\n\\\\n## FP32 精度效应确认 (2026-05-20)\\\\nFP32 的 8.5pp accuracy gap 中 97.4% 是精度效应（非引擎 confound）。BF16-trained model 用 FP32 推理表现更差，可能因为权重从 BF16 加载到 FP32 时的数值行为差异。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 790, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01K7AL2fpPZiLZyhDeHBuaaJ","session_id":"7a1cd9cb-5673-4b3d-b760-963c998bdaf6","uuid":"62a39ace-5989-4cd4-ae90-4d26e7414e38","timestamp":"2026-05-20T23:41:11.089Z"}
